  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You know your way around the most labyrinthine of urban environments.</p><ul><li><p>You have <strong>Advantage</strong> on checks to hide or search in streets and alleys.</p></li><li><p>You have <strong>Advantage</strong> on checks to locate someone or something in a city, such as a specific person, a public building, or a hive of criminal activity.</p></li><li><p>You naturally know which streets and pathways to take, and you cannot normally become lost while in a city.</p></li></ul>",
